OL,3,GNEWSAArena boss departs after 24 years
OL,4,Aof big name bookings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Nottingham's
OL,7,FMotorpoint Arena is stepping down after
OL,8,F24 years of bringing some of the
OL,9,Fbiggest names in showbiz to Nottingham.
OL,11,FMartin Ingham began his career at the
OL,12,Fvenue in 2002 as a financial consultant
OL,13,Fwhile working for Nottingham City
OL,14,FCouncil.
OL,16,FHis initial spell was supposed to be on
OL,17,Fa two-week placement, but he stayed for
OL,18,Fover two decades and went on to run the
OL,19,Farena as it welcomed major stars
OL,20,Fincluding Elton John, Dolly Parton,
OL,21,FBeyonce and Bryan Adams.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
