OL,3,GNEWSAArena boss departs after 24 years
OL,4,Aof big name bookings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the rise of artist residencies
OL,7,Fposed a fresh challenge for regional
OL,8,Fvenues and there was "work to do" to
OL,9,Fkeep bringing high profile artists back
OL,10,Fto Nottingham.
